  "description": "In a wasteland where the dead hunt the living, Jay Lee’s only light is Won. For seven years, they have wandered together, bound by a love that Won has carefully kept hidden. When a single night of intimacy finally breaks the tension, it feels like a new beginning. Instead, it is the beginning of the end. When a sudden crisis exposes Won’s true identity, it triggers a violent separation that neither saw coming. In a world defined by hunger, the most dangerous thing Jay ever did was lose his heart to a mystery.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
